doc Counting loop over an inclusive range. It has no backend: it expands into let, while, <=, = and +.
needs std/let std/while std/le std/assign std/add
syntax statement
  for {i: newvar} = {from: expr int} to {to: expr int} {body: block} end
expand
  let {i} = {from}
  while {i} <= {to}
    {body}
    {i} = {i} + 1
  end
